# Slime NaN-reward masking patch
# Generated: 2026-05-05
# Purpose: treat float('nan') from custom_rm as sample-level mask
#   - Sets sample.remove_sample=True (downstream zeros loss_mask)
#   - Fills NaN with group-local mean so GRPO/GSPO stays clean
# See slime_integration/routing_rm.py for the NaN-emitting side.
#
# Apply on a slime checkout with:
#     cd /root/slime   # (or wherever slime is installed)
#     git apply --check /tmp/slime_nan_mask.patch
#     git apply        /tmp/slime_nan_mask.patch
#
# Roll back with:
#     git apply --reverse /tmp/slime_nan_mask.patch
#
